Azul Calçados!', 319.99, 217.6, NULL, 'Women Shoes > Sneakers', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-824i5-mfie3s028t8vfe', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F448506781%2F22794492165', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
