g > Tools & Home Improvement > Wall Paints & Coatings', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rfi3-m9ss40ucy3s284', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1425275679%2F22898510305', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
