mbalagem: Altura 28 cm x Largura 28 cm x Comprimento 57 cm Certificado de Registro INMETRO nº 002697/2022 Garantia de 90 dias', 275.0, 275.0, NULL, 'Mom & Baby > Toys > Toy Vehicles', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-820l5-mnvfcoe4wdfq14', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F364932311%2F47809978615', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
